# slug: ch53-expressions
# source: chapters/ch53.tex:151
# label: alg:ch53-expressions
# pseudocode source: chapters/ch53.tex:154
# caption: Classify addition and subtraction in a simple relocatable-expression domain.

REQUIRE tagged operands with checked offsets; operator plus or minus
ENSURE absolute result, one-base result, or explicit unsupported-expression error
IF both operands are absolute THEN
  compute the checked integer operation
ELSE IF one-base left operand and absolute right operand THEN
  preserve the base and adjust its offset with checked arithmetic
ELSE IF absolute left plus one-base right THEN
  preserve the right base and add the absolute offset
ELSE IF subtracting two final offsets with the same base THEN
  return their checked absolute difference
ELSE
  reject or retain a richer symbolic expression supported by the object format
END IF

